  "details": "Often, we see hand sign animations that prioritize the animation of the handsign to create a nice shape.\nHowever, I've experienced a situation where the handsign is fixed when the \"Gesture Toggle\" feature is used to lock it in place, making it impossible to represent the hands.\nTo avoid this, I'd like to have a function to get the state of Gesture Toggle.",
